In `writer.test.ts`: merge under threshold, translation routing+space-joining into the folded cue, no merge across speakers, no merge at threshold, unlabeled no-merge, `mergeMaxS: 0` = byte-identical output, new-run cue numbering. In `srt.test.ts`: unit coverage for the merge helper (translation-line preservation, empty file) and the upsert helper.

`npm test`: 158 pass (16 files). `npm run typecheck`: clean.
